<view class="screen {{reducedEffects ? 'reduced-effects' : ''}}">
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{success}}">{{success}}</view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在更新预约…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{item}}">
    <view class="eyebrow">RESERVATION / {{item.kind_label}}</view><view class="status-title">{{item.status_label}}</view><view class="detail-code">{{item.code}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.next_step}}" class="card next-step plain-card"><view class="section-label">下一步</view><view class="card-title">{{item.next_step.title}}</view><view class="small-copy">{{item.next_step.action}}</view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">当前责任岗位</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.next_step.responsible_role}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">交接或办理地点</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.next_step.location}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="card plain-card"><view class="card-title">{{item.resource_name}}</view><view class="card-meta">{{item.time_label}}</view><view class="kv top-gap"><text class="kv-key">实验室</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.lab_name}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">确认方式</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.approval_mode === 'AUTO' ? '自动确认' : '人工审核'}}</text></view><view class="kv"><text class="kv-key">使用目的</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.purpose}}</text></view><view class="kv" wx:if="{{item.kind === 'ROOM'}}"><text class="kv-key">参与人数</text><text class="kv-value">{{item.participants}} 人</text></view><view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.reason}}">{{item.reason}}</view></view>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.status === 'PENDING'}}">待审核申请不占用时段，也不代表已保留资源，请以最终结果为准。</view>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.status === 'CONFIRMED' && !item.review_required}}">预约已确认，实际领取或入场仍须由管理员现场核验办理，请按下一步指引到场。</view>
    <view class="notice" wx:if="{{item.review_required}}">此预约正在复核，暂不能办理设备领取或场地入场，请等待管理员处理。</view>
    <view class="section-label">预约进度</view><view class="card plain-card"><view class="hint" wx:if="{{item.timeline_has_more}}">显示最近100条，共{{item.timeline_total}}条。完整历史请在网页端预约详情查看。</view><view class="timeline-item" wx:for="{{item.timeline}}" wx:for-item="event" wx:key="id"><view class="timeline-title">{{event.label}}</view><view class="timeline-time">{{event.time_label}} · {{event.actor}}</view><view class="timeline-reason">{{event.reason}}</view></view><view class="hint" wx:if="{{!item.timeline.length}}">暂无过程记录，请刷新后核对。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.supplements.length}}"><view class="section-label">审核沟通与补充说明</view><view class="card plain-card"><view class="hint" wx:if="{{item.supplements_has_more}}">显示最近100条，共{{item.supplements_total}}条。完整沟通记录请在网页端预约详情查看。</view><view class="timeline-item" wx:for="{{item.supplements}}" wx:for-item="note" wx:key="id"><view class="timeline-title">{{note.kind === 'REQUEST_INFO' ? '管理员要求补充' : '申请人补充说明'}}</view><view class="timeline-time">{{note.time_label}} · {{note.actor}}</view><view class="timeline-reason">{{note.content}}</view></view></view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{item.can_supplement || supplementUnknown}}"><view class="section-label">补充申请说明</view><view class="card plain-card"><view wx:if="{{supplementUnknown}}" class="notice">上一项补充结果尚未确认，请先核对原内容并重试。<button class="text-button" hover-class="control-pressed" bindtap="checkSupplement" disabled="{{busy}}">核对原操作结果</button><button class="text-button" hover-class="control-pressed" bindtap="restoreSupplement">恢复原提交内容</button></view><text class="field-label">补充说明</text><view class="field-box"><textarea value="{{form.supplement}}" data-field="supplement" bindinput="input" placeholder="补充本次用途、课程安排或管理员要求的信息" maxlength="1500" /></view><button class="secondary top-gap" hover-class="control-pressed" bindtap="supplement" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{supplementUnknown ? '重试原补充说明' : '提交补充说明'}}</button><view class="hint">补充不代表审核通过；仅待审核申请可以追加新的说明，历史内容不会覆盖。</view></view></view>
    <button wx:if="{{item.can_report}}" class="secondary top-gap" hover-class="control-pressed" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" bindtap="reportIncident">报告关联资源异常</button>
    <view wx:if="{{item.can_cancel}}"><view class="section-label">需要调整计划？</view><view class="card plain-card"><text class="field-label">取消原因</text><view class="field-box"><textarea value="{{form.reason}}" data-field="reason" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：课程安排调整" maxlength="1500" /></view><button hover-class="control-pressed" hover-start-time="20" hover-stay-time="80" class="danger-button top-gap" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" loading="{{busy}}">取消本次预约</button><view class="hint">仅可取消本人尚未开始且未使用的预约。</view></view></view>
  </view>
</view>
